ACCOUNT BANS, THIRD-PARTY CLAIMS AND LEGAL FEES. THE WORK IS PROVIDED FREE OF
CHARGE, AND THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER'S TOTAL AGGREGATE LIABILITY SHALL NOT EXCEED
THE AMOUNT YOU ACTUALLY PAID FOR THE WORK (ZERO).

**9. Miscellaneous.** This license is the entire agreement regarding the
Work; if any provision is held invalid, the remaining provisions remain in
